---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+16105550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(610) 555-0199';
---
<Layout 
  title="Strange HVAC Noises Phoenixville PA | HVAC Repair"
  description="Banging, rattling, or squealing HVAC sounds in Phoenixville. Diagnose and fix before bigger failures."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> → Problems → Strange Noises from Your HVAC</div>
      <h1>Strange Noises from Your HVAC in Phoenixville, PA</h1>
      <p>Banging, rattling, or squealing HVAC sounds in Phoenixville. Diagnose and fix before bigger failures.</p>
      <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Call {phoneDisplay}</a>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content-block">
      <h2>What Causes This Problem</h2>
      <p>Common causes include worn parts, dirty filters, electrical issues, refrigerant problems, or failing motors. Our technicians diagnose the root cause rather than guessing.</p>
      <h2>What We Do</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Full system inspection with proper instruments</li>
        <li>Clear explanation of findings and written estimate</li>
        <li>Repair with quality parts when approved</li>
        <li>Performance verification before we leave</li>
      </ol>
      <p>Most issues are resolved on the first visit. Call us for same-day service in Phoenixville and surrounding Chester County communities.</p>
      <div style="margin-top:2.5rem;text-align:center">
        <a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Service — {phoneDisplay}</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
